{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"Math Master": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) a - b = 7 এবং ab = 60 হলে, a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 169", "option2": "খ) 178", "option3": "গ) 160", "option4": "ঘ) 148", "answer": "1", "exp": "a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> <br />= (a - b)<sup>2</sup> + 2ab <br />= 7<sup>2</sup> + 2 &times; 60 <br />= 49 + 120 <br />= 169"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) x - 1/x = 5 হলে, (x + 1/x)<sup>2</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 23", "option2": "খ) 21", "option3": "গ) 27", "option4": "ঘ) 29", "answer": "4", "exp": "(x + 1/x)<sup>2</sup> <br />= (x - 1/x)<sup>2</sup> + 4.x.1/x <br />= 52 + 4 <br />= 25 + 4 <br />=29"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) (x + 6)(x + 4) কে দুইটি রাশির বর্গের অন্তরফল রূপে প্রকাশ - ", "option1": "ক) (x + 2)<sup>2</sup> - 1<sup>2</sup>", "option2": "খ) (x + 3)<sup>2</sup> - 1<sup>2</sup>", "option3": "গ) (x + 5)<sup>2</sup> - 1<sup>2</sup>", "option4": "ঘ) (x + 4)<sup>2</sup> - 1<sup>2</sup>", "answer": "3", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/0701.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"422\" height=\"222\" />"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) a<sup>2</sup> - 7a + 1 = 0 হলে, a<sup>3</sup> + 1/a<sup>3</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 364", "option2": "খ) 322", "option3": "গ) 212", "option4": "ঘ) 343", "answer": "2", "exp": "a<sup>2</sup> - 7a + 1 = 0<br />&rArr; a<sup>2</sup> + 1 = 7a<br />&rArr; (a<sup>2</sup> + 1)/a = 7<br />&rArr; a + 1/a = 7<br /><br />a<sup>3</sup> + 1/a<sup>3</sup>&nbsp; <br />= (a + 1/a)<sup>3</sup> - 3.a.1/a(a + 1/a) <br />= 7<sup>3</sup> - 3 &times; 7 <br />= 343 - 21 <br />= 322"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/0702.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"419\" height=\"26\" /> -&nbsp;", "option1": "ক) 507", "option2": "খ) 512", "option3": "গ) 517", "option4": "ঘ) 523", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/0703.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"503\" height=\"173\" />"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/0704.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"24\" />", "option1": "ক) 3", "option2": "খ) 4", "option3": "গ) 7", "option4": "ঘ) 15", "answer": "3", "exp": "(8a - 2b) + (- 7a + 4b)<br />= (8 &times; 3 - 2 &times; 2) + ( -7 &times; 3 + 4 &times; 2)<br />= (24 - 4) + ( - 21 + 8) <br />= 20 - 13 <br />= 7"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/0705.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"416\" height=\"37\" />-&nbsp;", "option1": "ক) 2x<sup>2</sup> - 8x + 10", "option2": "খ) x<sup>2</sup> - 8x + 10", "option3": "গ) 2x<sup>2</sup> - 7x + 10", "option4": "ঘ) 2x<sup>2</sup> - 8x + 12", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/0706.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"470\" height=\"360\" />"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/0707.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"242\" height=\"33\" />-&nbsp;", "option1": "ক) a<sup>3</sup> - 3a<sup>2</sup>b + 3ab<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;", "option2": "খ) a<sup>3</sup> + 3a<sup>2</sup>b + 3ab<sup>2</sup> - b<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;", "option3": "গ) a<sup>3</sup> + 3a<sup>2</sup>b - 3ab<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;", "option4": "ঘ) a<sup>3</sup> - 3a<sup>2</sup>b + 3ab<sup>2</sup> - b<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;", "answer": "4", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/0708.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"437\" height=\"160\" />"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) (a + 1)(a - 1)(a<sup>2</sup> + 1) = ?", "option1": "ক) a<sup>2</sup> - 1", "option2": "খ) a<sup>4</sup> - 1", "option3": "গ) a<sup>3</sup> - 1", "option4": "ঘ) a<sup>4</sup> + 1", "answer": "2", "exp": "(a + 1)(a - 1)(a<sup>2</sup> + 1)<br />= (a<sup>2</sup> - 1)(a<sup>2</sup> + 1)<br />= a<sup>4</sup> - 1"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/0710.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"410\" height=\"27\" />", "option1": "ক) 1", "option2": "খ) 2", "option3": "গ) 1 - x<sup>2</sup>", "option4": "ঘ) x<sup>2</sup> - 1", "answer": "2", "exp": "(x<sup>2</sup> + 3) + (x<sup>2</sup> - 2) + ( - 2x<sup>2</sup> + 1) <br />= x<sup>2</sup> + 3 + x<sup>2</sup> - 2 - 2x<sup>2</sup> + 1 <br />= 2"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) দুটি ক্ষুদ্রতম সংখ্যার অনুপাত ৫ : ৬। গ.সা.গু. ৪ হলে ল.সা.গু. কত?", "option1": "ক) ১০০", "option2": "খ) ১১২", "option3": "গ) ১২০", "option4": "ঘ) ১৬০", "answer": "3", "exp": "সংখ্যা দুইটি ৫ক ও ৬ক হলে, এদের গ.সা.গু = ক<br />অতএব, ক = ৪<br />সংখ্যা দুইটি ৫ &times; ৪ ও ৬ &times; ৪ অর্থাৎ ২০ ও ২৪<br />২০ ও ২৪ এর ল.সা.গু ১২০"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/0711.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"327\" height=\"30\" /> কত?", "option1": "ক) x + 1", "option2": "খ) x + 2", "option3": "গ) x + 3", "option4": "ঘ) 2(x + 2)", "answer": "2", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/0712.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"211\" />"}, {"id": "13", "question": "১৩) 9x<sup>2</sup> - 25y<sup>2</sup> এবং&nbsp; 15ax - 25ay এর গ.সা.গু. কত?", "option1": "ক) 3x + 5y", "option2": "খ) 3x - 5y", "option3": "গ) 5x - 3y", "option4": "ঘ) 2x - 3y", "answer": "2", "exp": "১ম রাশি = 9x<sup>2</sup> - 25y<sup>2</sup> <br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= (3x)<sup>2</sup> - (5y)<sup>2</sup><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= (3x + 5y)(3x - 5y)<br /><br />২য় রাশি = 15ax - 25ay<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = 5a(3x - 5y)<br /><br />নির্ণেয় গ.সা.গু. = 3x - 5y"}, {"id": "14", "question": "১৪) দুইটি সংখ্যার গ.সা.গু. ১৬ এবং ল.সা.গু. ১৯২। একটি সংখ্যা ৪৮ হলে অপর সংখ্যা কত?", "option1": "ক) ৬০", "option2": "খ) ৬২", "option3": "গ) ৬৪", "option4": "ঘ) ৬৮", "answer": "3", "exp": "আমরা জানি দুইটি সংখ্যার গুনফল = ল.সা.গু. &times; গ.সা.গু.<br />তাহলে, ৪৮ &times; অপর সংখ্যা = ১৬ &times; ১৯২<br />অপর সংখ্যা = ৬৪"}, {"id": "15", "question": "১৫) দুটি সংখ্যার যোগফল ৬০। তাদের বিয়োগফল, যোগফলের ১/৩ অংশ। সংখ্যা দুটির লসাগু কত?", "option1": "ক) ২০", "option2": "খ) ৩০", "option3": "গ) ৪০", "option4": "ঘ) ৬০", "answer": "3", "exp": "সংখ্যা দুইটি ক ও খ হলে, <br />ক + খ = ৬০ <br />এবং ক - খ = (ক + খ)/৩<br />সুতরাং ৩(ক - খ) = ৬০<br />ক - খ = ২০<br />ক = ৪০<br />খ = ২০<br />২০ ও ৪০ এর লসাগু = ৪০"}, {"id": "16", "question": "১৬) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/0713.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"245\" height=\"76\" /> = কত?", "option1": "ক) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/0716.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"78\" />", "option2": "খ) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/0717.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"112\" height=\"36\" />", "option3": "গ) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/0718.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"86\" height=\"35\" />", "option4": "ঘ) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/0719.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"181\" height=\"82\" />", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/0714_becvziZ.PNG\" alt=\"\" /><br /><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/071